<p class="document-label">Privacy policy</p>
<p class="document-lead">This Privacy Policy explains how we process your personal data when you use the Wesal application, website and services, in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR/DSGVO), the German Federal Data Protection Act (BDSG), and the Telecommunications and Digital Services Data Protection Act (TDDDG). Wesal is a digital marriage-introduction platform for people seeking a serious marriage. It is intended only for people aged 18 or over.</p>
<p>This policy provides the information required by law. Reading it does not mean that you consent to external publication or to the processing of special-category personal data. Whenever your consent is required, we ask for it separately and clearly, using a box that is not pre-selected.</p>

