    <h2>1. Who is responsible for your data?</h2>
    <p>The controller responsible for processing your personal data within the meaning of Article 4(7) GDPR is:</p>
    <p><strong>Hulul – Inhaber Malek Alabdulah (Hulul – sole proprietorship of Malek Alabdulah)</strong></p>
    <p>Service: Wesal – marriage introductions</p>
    <p>Eisenbahnstr. 106, 04315 Leipzig, Germany</p>
