</section>

<section class="legal-section" id="privacy-2">
    <h2>2. Contact about data protection</h2>
    <p>The person responsible for data protection at Wesal is the business owner, Malek Alabdulah. Send questions and requests concerning your personal data to <a href="mailto:wesalsyrien@gmail.com">wesalsyrien@gmail.com</a> or to the postal address in section 1.</p>
</section>

